   "top": {
    "Admind Branding & Communications is the largest global branding agency from Poland with officeslocated in Krakw, Amsterdam, Odessa, Bangkok, and Zrich. Our team consists of more than 140 creative experts from over 15 countries. Admind is an international community of professionals specialized in design, branding strategy, and conscious branding. ": 1,
    "With more than 20 years of experience, more than 50 specialists in the Netherlands and India, we develop digital solutions such as websites, webshops and applications. We help you to realize your online ambitions.": 1,
    "Bright8 is een creatief fullservice marketing en PRbureau met een internationaal bereik. Ben je op zoek naar een duurzame strategie, onderscheidende creatie en/of effectieve marketing en PRcampagnes Ons team van veelzijdige internationale marketeers, PRmanagers en creatives heeft de kennis, tijd en aandacht om niet alleen aan jouw vraag te voldoen, maar om je elke keer weer te verrassen met wat nog meer kan.Hoe we dat doen We hebben al deze disciplines zelf in huis, inclusief een inhouse studio, zodat we snel kunnen schakelen en controle houden over de uitvoering. We zorgen ervoor dat we jouw propositie en markt goed kennen en laten marketing en PR naadloos op elkaar aansluiten.": 1,
    "We are an independent design & development agency established in 2017 with R&D in Ukraine and sales office in Netherlands. We collaborate with brands and startups to accelerate their growth. ": 1,
    "Codelevate is an Amsterdam based software development agency that builds custom applications that scale.": 1,
    "We Build Brands For A Purpose Driven WorldIs there a disconnect between what your company stands for and what your brand communicates Are you Mercedes, but your brand communicates like OpelThese are interesting times that ask a lot from brands when it comes to staying relevant and making an impact.Finding the right connection with your audience starts with a solid foundation.Smaac is a Strategy and Branding agency that helps startups and companies thrive by designing and developing wellpositioned brands that stand the test of time.\"We build brands for a purposedriven world\"Start you change today and give us a call.": 1,
    "Ensuring you harness the power of video & animationShoot You are a creative agency specializing in animation and video production for the past two decades. Based in the Netherlands, Germany, England and the United States, we work globally to produce content for your brand including internal communications, commercials and social media.Our current client base includes 11 'Fortune 500' companies (J.P Morgan, Honeywell, HPE), main industry players (Activision, Aggreko, Siemens), International Organisations (European Commission, United Nations, UNICEF) and a large number of Public Relation & Advertising agencies.Our clients come back to us again and again because we genuinely care about your business. We take the time to understand your communication objectives and target audience, so we can deliver a production which reflects your brand values and the story you want to tell. We are more than a creative agency, we are your media partner.": 1,
    "We design world class digital experiences that deliver exceptional business outcomes for enterprise companies. ": 1,
    "We believe in the transformative power of creativity as a driver of growth and change. Therefore we work alongside clients that have creativity in their DNA to create immersive brand experiences for a creative audience.": 1,
    "Devstark is a fullcycle custom application development company. We develop web products and solutions using modern technologies to optimize businesses.": 1
